Changes from the original (Apache-2.0 Section 4(b) statement of changes):
- Rebranded to "Open Notebook"; removed all SurfSense names and trademarks.
- Re-pointed to the Open Notebook backend and its /api/v1 wire contract.
- Relabeled "search space" -> "notebook" in user-facing strings (internal
  field names such as searchSpaceId are retained).
- Changed connector/search-space id types from numeric to string, because
  Open Notebook uses SurrealDB string record ids.
- Changed the default server URL to http://localhost:5055.

The reused sync/queue/payload/vault-identity/excludes machinery is carried
over from SurfSense with only the above branding and type changes.
